<p style="margin:20px 0"><a href="https://stjosephs.jcs-ilearn.example/teaching" style="display:inline-block;background:#1d4ed8;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:6px;font-weight:bold">Open your teaching dashboard</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:13px;color:#475569;word-break:break-all">https://stjosephs.jcs-ilearn.example/teaching</p>

